# "Whenever a legendary creature you control enters, any number of target players each mill a card and lose 1 life."
# Tinybones targets nobody for its discard ability on turn 1. On turn 3 Ornithopter, not legendary, enters and asks for no target
# (`! Bot1.Target`); then Aunt May, a legendary creature, enters and Bot1 targets both players: each mills the top card
# of their library and loses 1 life (19 life each). Each mills a known top card: Bot1 the Forest, Bot2 the Mountain (beside the Island it discarded at cleanup to hand size).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Tinybones Joins Up
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Aunt May
Plains
Plains
Plains
Forest
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x8
Mountain
Island x11

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tinybones Joins Up.Cast
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Target
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Aunt May.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1; Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
Bot2.Graveyard = Mountain; Island
